   IT ALSO MAKES A DUMMY FILE IN YOUR UPLOAD DIR, SO IF ANYBODY WANTS TO
   UPLOAD IT, IT WILL BE SKIPPED AFTER ALL! THIS PREVENTS LAME UPLOADS!
                                 
