@node INSTALL "INSTALLATION"

            INSTALL IT LIKE THE WAY IT IS DONE IN THE ARCHIVE. 
CREATE (IF YOU DOESN'T HAVE IT YET..) A DIRECTORY DOORS:TFADOORS/ AND COPY
THE TfaSKIP.x INTO THIS DIRECTORY. COPY THE ICON IN BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD TO
YOUR OWN BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD AND FEEL FREE TO EDIT THE ACCESS LEVEL OF IT!

